<!--
  Hindi translations for the strings extracted so far: Home, Search and Onboarding.

  Two conventions, both deliberate:

  - Cricket terms stay in English where that is how they are said in Hindi commentary and in the
    ground — "over", "wicket", "LBW". Translating them would read as stilted, not as localised.
  - Counts go through plurals rather than string concatenation, because Hindi's plural rules are
    not English's and "team" + "s" has no correct translation.

  Machine-assisted and NOT reviewed by a native speaker. Worth a pass by one before this ships to
  users — the strings are correct in meaning but the register may not be right everywhere.
-->
